            <div class="eco-details">
              <div><span>Трафик:</span> 50-60k</div>
              <div><span>CR:</span> 0.6% - 0.8%</div>
              <div><span>Чеков:</span> 225 - 384</div>
              <div><span>AOV:</span> 8 500 ₽</div>
            </div>
            <div class="eco-roi">⚡ Окупаемость инвестиций (5.46M ₽) за 4–6 месяцев</div>
          </div>

          <div class="fashion-card eco-card">
            <div class="eco-tag">ФАЗА 2: МАСШТАБИРОВАНИЕ</div>
            <div class="eco-revenue">8.7 – 12.6 млн ₽ / мес</div>
            <div class="eco-details">
              <div><span>Трафик:</span> 85-110k</div>
              <div><span>CR:</span> 1.4% - 1.6%</div>
              <div><span>Чеков:</span> 975 - 1408</div>
              <div><span>AOV:</span> 9 000 ₽</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="fashion-card eco-card">
            <div class="eco-tag">ФАЗА 3: ЭКОСИСТЕМА</div>
            <div class="eco-revenue">26.6 – 41.9 млн ₽ / мес</div>
            <div class="eco-details">
              <div><span>Трафик:</span> 150-200k</div>
              <div><span>CR:</span> 2.2% - 2.6%</div>
              <div><span>Чеков:</span> 2805 - 4420</div>
